      "v": 3,
      "zh": "于是耶和华问我说：「耶利米你看见甚么？」我说：「我看见无花果，好的极好，坏的极坏，坏得不可吃。」",
      "en": "The Lord said to me, “What do you see, Jeremiah?” I answered, “I see figs. The good ones look very good. But the bad ones look very bad, so bad that they cannot be eaten.”",
